cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "DGA Detection & Analysis Framework"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end research pipeline for detecting Domain Generation Algorithm
  (DGA) malware in DNS traffic at scale: pcap parsing, Public Suffix List
  splitting, LSTM domain classification, PostgreSQL storage of ~393 million DNS
  messages, and windowed host-level analysis.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Principi
    given-names: Lorenzo
    email: l.principi8@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Università Politecnica delle Marche"
repository-code: "https://github.com/princio/dga-detection-analysis-framework"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - DGA
  - malware detection
  - DNS
  - LSTM
  - network traffic analysis
  - botnet detection

